The files in this folder are output of n8n-organizer, generated from four
workflows in the Zie619/n8n-workflows collection:

  https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows
  commit ae8cf6dc5b873cbb4f74587aa9180ed3a9f70682 (2025-09-29)

  Error/0456_Error_Gmail_Send_Triggered.json
  Filter/1667_Filter_Summarize_Automation_Triggered.json
  Manual/0943_Manual_Xml_Automation_Triggered.json
  Splitout/1564_Splitout_Manual_Create_Webhook.json

The output holds workflow names, node names and node types taken from those
files. The workflow JSON itself is not included here.

The collection was published under the MIT License in commit 75cb1e57
(2025-11-03); the same workflows are present in that licensed version. Its
